  "description": "This NuGet package includes the required files to create an ASP.NET and ASP.NET Core MVC web application with support for the document processing Web API of TX Text Control DS Server. Using the document processing Web API, you can merge MS Word compatible templates with JSON data to create Adobe PDF documents and other supported formats. At least a trial version of TX Text Control DS Server is required to use this NuGet package.\n\nThis package version is meant for use with DS Server 4.0.0.",
